{"body":"Bumps the maven-minor-and-patch group with 1 update in the /benchmarks/java directory: [org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin](https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin).\n\nUpdates `org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin` from 3.6.4 to 3.7.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/releases\">org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.7.0</h2>\n<p>Exec Maven Plugin 3.7.0 raises the minimum Maven version to 3.9.0, adds three long-requested <code>exec:java</code> options, and fixes a batch of old bugs in how commands and Java programs are started. Java 8 is still enough to run it. Builds on Maven 3.6.3 to 3.8.x must stay on 3.6.4.</p>\n<h2>✨ Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maven 3.9.0 or later is required</strong> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/548\">#548</a>). Older Maven versions fail at startup with a prerequisite error.</li>\n<li><strong><code>classpathDependencyExcludes</code></strong> removes chosen dependencies from the class path of <code>exec:java</code> and <code>exec:exec</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/562\">#562</a>, requested in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/68\">#68</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/pramodanarase\"><code>@​pramodanarase</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong><code>mainClass</code> from the manifest.</strong> When <code>executableDependency</code> is set and <code>mainClass</code> is not, the <code>Main-Class</code> attribute of that dependency's manifest is used (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/563\">#563</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/89\">#89</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/sewe\"><code>@​sewe</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong><code>keepClassLoaderOpen</code></strong> leaves the <code>exec:java</code> class loader open after the program returns, so shutdown hooks and background threads can still load classes (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/561\">#561</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/513\">#513</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/tzaeschke\"><code>@​tzaeschke</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong><code>exec:java</code> threading.</strong> The main class runs in a non-daemon bootstrap thread that the plugin waits for, so IDE builds such as m2e no longer interrupt it (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/572\">#572</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/526\">#526</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/sbj42\"><code>@​sbj42</code></a>). A program's own <code>UncaughtExceptionHandler</code> now receives its uncaught exceptions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/569\">#569</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/141\">#141</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/dedeibel\"><code>@​dedeibel</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong><code>exec:exec</code> fixes.</strong> <code>async</code> together with <code>outputFile</code> keeps the output file open until the process ends (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/565\">#565</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/63\">#63</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/tarioch\"><code>@​tarioch</code></a>). A relative <code>executable</code> resolves against <code>workingDirectory</code> again (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/567\">#567</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/92\">#92</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/deepakab03\"><code>@​deepakab03</code></a>). Unquoted line breaks and tabs in <code>commandlineArgs</code> count as spaces instead of creating empty arguments (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/571\">#571</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/466\">#466</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/cebaa\"><code>@​cebaa</code></a>). A failed command logs its message at error level and keeps the stack trace for <code>-X</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/568\">#568</a>).</li>\n<li><strong>Module path.</strong> Resource directories stay off the module path (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/560\">#560</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/534\">#534</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/inaldt\"><code>@​inaldt</code></a>), and the <code>%modulepath</code> token is handled (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/532\">#532</a> by <a href=\"https://github.com/pzygielo\"><code>@​pzygielo</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong>Documentation</strong> moved from APT to Markdown, and the module path argument file is now documented (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/557\">#557</a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/566\">#566</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚨 Removed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Maven 3.9.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/548\">#548</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚀 New features and improvements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add keepClassLoaderOpen to exec:java (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/561\">#561</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Add classpathDependencyExcludes (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/562\">#562</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Read mainClass from the executableDependency manifest (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/563\">#563</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🐛 Bug Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Log only the message of a failed command at error level (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/568\">#568</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Pass uncaught exceptions to the handlers of the program (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/569\">#569</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Resolve a relative executable against the working directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/567\">#567</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Treat unquoted line breaks and tabs in the arguments as spaces (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/571\">#571</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Run the main class in a non-daemon bootstrap thread (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/572\">#572</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Keep the output file open for asynchronous executions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/565\">#565</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Keep resource directories off the module path (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/560\">#560</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Handle <code>%modulepath</code> token (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/532\">#532</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/pzygielo\"><code>@​pzygielo</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📝 Documentation updates</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Document the module path argument file (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/566\">#566</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Convert the site documents from APT to Markdown (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/557\">#557</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Add AGENTS.md (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/552\">#552</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>👻 Maintenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ignore JVM option notices in the mexec-86 output check (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/564\">#564</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Declare the Maven artifacts the code uses (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/553\">#553</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Remove redundant mojo.java.target property (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/554\">#554</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Keep Dependabot on Maven 3.9.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/550\">#550</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n<li>Keep plexus-xml on 3.x in Dependabot (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/issues/541\">#541</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/slachiewicz\"><code>@​slachiewicz</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔧 Build</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/ffbdb9f6b4532b1ce827709f0c9edacfa6b0eec2\"><code>ffbdb9f</code></a> [maven-release-plugin] prepare release 3.7.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/91287caceefed269ecabcd0c4e6cc36666091a3d\"><code>91287ca</code></a> Ignore JVM option notices in the mexec-86 output check</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/426e05d317648a5d8570afffb7e02ac78c3864ef\"><code>426e05d</code></a> Log only the message of a failed command at error level</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/82a780b89396ccdeb53ab0b779f68b78f781d250\"><code>82a780b</code></a> Pass uncaught exceptions to the handlers of the program</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/f2bace737c4336ce9f3c1b870a1ef8a48e313b4b\"><code>f2bace7</code></a> Resolve a relative executable against the working directory</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/0d8df62776c28af48a373d6a30adc1ab4c08fd02\"><code>0d8df62</code></a> Treat unquoted line breaks and tabs in the arguments as spaces</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/c177b6f9151a2291e7c2247ccbd5efd6a6f083bb\"><code>c177b6f</code></a> Run the main class in a non-daemon bootstrap thread</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/1ea4f68c83d81494facb1b54a5d44a8bf5316a69\"><code>1ea4f68</code></a> Keep the output file open for asynchronous executions</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/8731bfda8fb458729c3b13d5fd4235fa790d2969\"><code>8731bfd</code></a> Document the module path argument file</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/commit/b323d779c5553f0c2bd639ab27791d2ef8045a1c\"><code>b323d77</code></a> Add keepClassLoaderOpen to exec:java</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/mojohaus/exec-maven-plugin/compare/3.6.4...3.7.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin&package-manager=maven&previous-version=3.6.4&new-version=3.7.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore <dependency name> major version` will close this group update PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for the specific dependency's major version (unless you unignore this specific dependency's major version or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore <dependency name> minor version` will close this group update PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for the specific dependency's minor version (unless you unignore this specific dependency's minor version or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore <dependency name>` will close this group update PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for the specific dependency (unless you unignore this specific dependency or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot unignore <dependency name>` will remove all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot unignore <dependency name> <ignore condition>` will remove the ignore condition of the specified dependency and ignore conditions\n\n\n</details>","headRefOid":"7922b0f73f348c7fd50a1c67bf7700d83a7fbca8","mergeStateStatus":"BEHIND","number":403,"statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:50Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908946/job/131547912352","name":"js / format","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:38Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908589/job/131547908620","name":"check-bom-consistency","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:03Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"bom-check"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:31Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908591/job/131547908116","name":"latest-stable","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:08Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"dependency freshness"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908946/job/131547912230","name":"js / lint","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:29Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:33Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908946/job/131547912000","name":"js / test","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:22Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:21Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43322908946/job/131547911392","name":"js / parity","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:11Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"